-2959460","kind":"announcement","title":"Looking for Fael is 15% off for a limited time! 🧩","summary":"Fael is missing. Now, it's up to you to uncover the truth. In Looking for Fael, your roommate has disappeared, leaving behind a strange voice message and a multifaceted maze of mysterious rooms filled with puzzles. Along the way, you'll have to:Explore surreal apartmentsSolve puzzles in the form of nostalgic mini-gamesDecipher the clues left behindQuestion the very nature of realityBut be careful: every apartment is connected, and your actions in one place can have unexpected consequences somewh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T17:01:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2959460-1842212951298996","game_id":"steam-2959460","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Matelotes","summary":"Dive into a dice light-RPG driven by randomness, strategy and procedural generation!Ahoy sailors,Matelotes will be released in Early Access in 2027!So, why Early Access? We chose Early Access for Matelotes to have the best version possible in V1. And who is better to help in this task than you, sailors!Matelotes is a mix of strategic management and randomness. Your feedback will be crucial in balancing the game and making the experience coherent. Also, the early access will give us the opportuni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T06:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2959460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14